      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "People have already made face tracking with the current state of OSC, so it's possible.\nIf you would have looked at the VRChat OSC GitHub, you would have also noticed that there is a future milestone for face tracking, which means OSC will later be expanded for better an easier face tracking support.\nThis is in general only the first version of OSC support for VRChat, it will be expanded further in later updates, including OSC for Udon.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
